This is an EJS template for the WDPR Profile V1 Navigation script.
It is rendered by the static server when the client requests the specific script URL.
The script initializes the navigation for the WDPR Profile application, detecting if
the user is on a mobile device and determining the brand code before initializing
the navigation controller.

